+
+  **Serve, on RIG-A, epoch E2** (julianmb ROCmFP4-FAST, 14.56 GB, DFlash2 at draft depth 2, palindrome,
+  16 rounds per slot): drafted decode **7.498 → 9.518 tok/s mean**, **+2.0199 [1.3212, 2.7186], 8 of 8
